---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="FAQ - Odiuko Educational Services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Questions parents ask</h1>
    <details><summary>Which classes do you tutor?</summary><p>Our focus is Basic 1 to 6. Contact us if your child is older.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Which subjects do you cover?</summary><p>Math, reading and spelling, and learning support such as homework help.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Is in-home tutoring different from online?</summary><p>No. Both offer the same lessons and the same standard of teaching.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How do I book?</summary><p>Use the contact page or message us on WhatsApp. We will talk through your child’s needs and agree a plan.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How will I know my child is improving?</summary><p>You will receive regular updates on what was covered and how your child is doing.</p></details>
    <p class="muted">[Add more questions and answers here.]</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>